OL,3,GNEWSADisappointment as motorway
OL,4,Ajunction plan scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil chiefs have described the
OL,7,Fgovernment's decision to scrap plans
OL,8,Ffor a new motorway junction as "deeply
OL,9,Fdisappointing".
OL,11,FGloucestershire County Council wanted
OL,12,Fto build a new M5 junction to the south
OL,13,Fof Tewkesbury to help unlock plans for
OL,14,F25,000 homes.
OL,16,FThe Department for Transport has now
OL,17,Fsaid that the scheme has been removed
OL,18,Ffrom its programme.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
