OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSADisappointment as motorway
OL,4,Ajunction plan scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FLisa Spivey, leader of Gloucestershire
OL,7,FCounty Council, said: "This is an
OL,8,Fextremely short-sighted and deeply
OL,9,Fdisappointing decision by the
OL,10,Fgovernment. The government cannot
OL,11,Fcontinue to demand that areas such as
OL,12,Fours deliver significant numbers of new
OL,13,Fhomes while refusing to invest in the
OL,14,Finfrastructure needed to support them."
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
